{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "bc280ff3b44a976796f1e3958ba4a132cf78611b16d624d1dfdb3acafd7665d1", "ja": "14歳のとまどい", "zh": "14岁的困惑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9fbf33b0cdac580ae9ec498cd9e8c7481ae2c5dc0b8eed36f7f0bdce057b897", "ja": "デュオ公演に向けてレッスンを進めるやよい\nと可奈は、話を聞いて来た響の言葉に驚く。\n「そんなえっちな歌を歌うなんて！」\nこの曲にはそんなオトナ要素が？と戸惑いつ\nつも二人はお姉さん達の気遣いを感じ取る。", "zh": "为了双人公演而进行练习的弥生和可奈，对听说此事赶来的响所说的话大吃一惊。\n“居然要唱那种色色的歌！”\n虽然对这首歌里竟然有这种成人要素感到困惑，两人还是察觉到了姐姐们的体贴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "75005c676f091953ac04933c1e6ecad41f356604993e20dbbb768269a0db0938", "ja": "（やよいと可奈のデュオ公演に向けて準備は着々と\n進行中。今日は今頃レッスンをしているはずだな……）", "zh": "（やよい和可奈的双人公演准备工作正在顺利进行。今天这个时候，她们应该正在练习吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "305c942afc7dedb36c5ea2ec8399611d2793303e837a020de9d24ae13f150755", "ja": "あら、お疲れさま。やよいちゃんと可奈ちゃんは、\nデュオ公演のレッスン？", "zh": "哎呀，辛苦啦。弥生和可奈是在为\n双人公演进行练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "145c4703f85304584a845e4a3faa0b5a97798b4c49556fdd57fe38bf741d1cd5", "ja": "はい！　このみさんは、\n今日はこれで終わりですか？", "zh": "是的！这次和可奈小姐的双人演出练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "16fd56d83194e1562cd33638d1b27e0255a3f57dc8675af140c558bb5017c7de", "ja": "ええ。\n午前中からみっちりレッスンだったから。", "zh": "是啊。因为从上午开始就一直在进行高强度的训练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "d780ecf12681c31f8027d807d7d27f317e7dfe9dd4bbf82affe67323344359c5", "ja": "でも、夕方から飲みに行けるって思ったら\nいくらでも頑張れちゃったわ～♪", "zh": "不过，一想到傍晚就能去喝酒，\n就觉得再怎么努力都没问题啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "56305abb6dc5489d81a61a54a24b78bd5183c2569b057f564e5a5181ea95e236", "ja": "大人ってそういうものなんだ～……。\nはっ！？　ねえ、やよいちゃん！", "zh": "原来大人都是这样的啊～……。\n啊！？等等，弥生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "ac843a657fe85a48283577c2b919c809ea311f1d72670bcd0da5a282c4d1f3d3", "ja": "うん！　このみさんは\n劇場で一番大人のお姉さん、だもんね……！", "zh": "嗯！因为木实姐是剧场里最成熟的大姐姐嘛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "172ca8f13b7dc090567d5f7a85ba4af44661daeceeb39e06d4ef67b896c95941", "ja": "？　どうしたの？\nふたりとも真剣な顔して……。", "zh": "？怎么了？你们两个都一脸认真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "4ef846f04d58b70233bf763c44c1bc6bc677f4a8c6850bbce037c709cd6c285c", "ja": "あの、私たちのデュオ公演、\n新曲がすごく大人っぽい曲で……！", "zh": "那个，我们双人演出的新歌，\n是一首非常成熟的曲子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "d193a9e195025d62ef4265f7508d0068f39494763f555ead12ce1c979b863545", "ja": "このみさんに見てもらって、\n感想を聞かせてほしくて……いいですかっ！？", "zh": "想请好美小姐帮忙看一下，再听听您的感想……可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "6c6ca6528eacdd6ec60f2e200c6b28e383451bf50272a3863e4217534d1be257", "ja": "え、ええ。全然構わないけど……。\nなんだかすごい気合いね……？", "zh": "诶、嗯。当然没问题……不过，你好像干劲十足啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "ed82903f09c133a7985b9f13818948cdca0a7cd5d160f2dc7620d6112088f09e", "ja": "ど、どうでしたか？\nこのみさん！", "zh": "怎、怎么样？\n好美小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "acd1e2c152e2be0dd404026e69bee2800e5d3e00e0ac5e8853b2c78a67a0f454", "ja": "この曲、この歌詞……。\nそういうこと、よね……？", "zh": "这首歌、这些歌词……  \n就是那么回事，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "fc174a1767f14c91cee99f16cbafabd4dd2b53502cec225091197bde1903050f", "ja": "……まず確認なんだけど、この新曲は\n{$P$}発案なのよね？", "zh": "……首先我想确认一下，这首新歌\n是{$P$}提议的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "7171d520faf628ad17ebf9cf9edddd2aa40225d8c31374815bad5fafc422fb4f", "ja": "？　はい、そうですけど……。", "zh": "？是的，没错……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "82bf121dadaa03f983c00864f46cb36c6cdf02a4c3022874fa71c6a85ca6be61", "ja": "そう……。コホン、{$P$}は\n事務室にいるはずよね。", "zh": "这样啊……咳咳，{$P$}应该在办公室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "056479e0b5512dc9d5872716179374855175ded2c4cb89a3acc80ff017169698", "ja": "ちょーっと話をしてくるから、\nふたりはここで待っていてちょうだい♪", "zh": "我去聊一会儿，你们两个就在这里等着吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "3b2e27324024653bb64767347fb10ddd06d4e2cffe1135d96633bfef0afd536f", "ja": "どういうことかな……？　私たちだと、\nあんまり大人っぽくなかったとか……？", "zh": "这是怎么回事呢……？难道是因为我们看起来不太成熟……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "10c727c01306ce95b1bb5aaff597a155036c17cfe422e7177a79ebb777a85fc2", "ja": "うう……わ、わかんないけど、待とう！", "zh": "呜呜……虽、虽然不明白，但先等着吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1020_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "484ceefa68906680666ec5ab9bafff984321e21e9ef7b945fe0522d782b56624", "ja": "やよいー！　可奈ー！　ダメだー！\nそんなの自分が絶対許さないぞ！", "zh": "弥生——！可奈——！不可以——！\n我绝对不会答应那种事的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "7dc3821ac65497bb07b9013d48bde0bf2973b22e58167806f010eb1515f35610", "ja": "響さん！？", "zh": "响姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "67a83e1df751f0226a6a9619985364d6d766a2a9502ea74c18ff1b5984049d6d", "ja": "ふたりともまだ中学生なのに、そんな……！\nえ……っ、えっ……！", "zh": "明明两个人都还只是初中生，怎么能这样……！\n诶……诶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "3ef1fe1fb533f0ffc9f8cba3218a6368f55fe526294beb88ca6347e8cd9320c2", "ja": "えっちな歌を歌うなんて！！", "zh": "居然要唱色情的歌！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "830fdd4dc768f1d40f6b208e016656570cf3b261284042aa6074c3a775ba45a8", "ja": "えっちな歌！？", "zh": "色色的歌！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "830fdd4dc768f1d40f6b208e016656570cf3b261284042aa6074c3a775ba45a8", "ja": "えっちな歌！？", "zh": "色色的歌！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "1553847f3bb9eaab14eed38c91269885a0e56a4ad457e6d0d22fb7957528eaa1", "ja": "ご、誤解があるぞ！　会話が聞こえてしまったのは\n仕方ないけど、話を聞いてくれ！", "zh": "有、有误会啊！你不小心听到了我们的谈话，这也没办法，但请听我解释！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "f3d7e516849231565b17976fd5eedb61b758946ebc1628dc000843fc7655b5f3", "ja": "もう響ちゃんったら！\n早とちりして勝手に走り出すんだもの！", "zh": "真是的，小响也真是的！\n居然自己想岔了就自顾自跑出去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1030_013hib", "source_sha256": "cc96a1f52c556fe82af3cdd3d42b92f16e1f49b055f1c55addea66652ed2dcde", "ja": "だって！　新曲はそういう曲だって聞いたぞ！\nこのみも抗議してたんじゃないの？", "zh": "可是！我听说新曲就是那样的曲子啊！\n你不也提出抗议了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "6910ffd67265c8bd01f2ddbeaa42714822a349ca807c7252198488d50d6f48dc", "ja": "抗議っていうか……私や莉緒ちゃんたち大人組が、\n相談役になるっていう話をしに行ったのよ。", "zh": "倒也不是抗议啦……我只是去说了一声，\n让我和莉绪她们成年组来当大家的咨询对象而已啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "cfc097c36e088bb4d36d922cc0905f6f50fa28dae1163b3671710950933bfefb", "ja": "そういう表現にはいつか触れるものだし……\nその辺、どう触れるかも全部含めて経験よね？", "zh": "迟早会接触到那种表达方式……\n至于该怎么接触，这些也全都是经验，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "6e0472384a52c1755bdae0f4ce3488f47a627340a340553936076bfb3e590b22", "ja": "そうですね。そういう狙いもあって……\n響は最後まで聞かないで走り出しちゃうから……。", "zh": "是啊，本来就有那方面的考虑……\n因为响总是不听到最后就直接跑出去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "b5c7e28040571cc142304420260c2b38b81b794d792ecc4b74a9949fa73adb68", "ja": "！！　じ、自分も、もちろんわかってた……ぞ？\nでも、それはそれ、これはこれっていうか……。", "zh": "！！我、我当然也知道……的吧？\n不过，那个是那个，这个是这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "92af731ded6449e726f5b521a02a67f33b96173a23d95aa69d540a2b65ac34ed", "ja": "あ、そうだ。それじゃ、響ちゃんにも\n相談役になってもらおうかしら？", "zh": "啊，对了。那就也请响来当我的顾问吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "159883740d66432a2d5775a46d2b6ea652cf5fdb5d5ec281a72acfdd0e68a96d", "ja": "年齢も近い分、きっと話しやすくて\n頼りになるんじゃない？", "zh": "年纪也相仿，肯定更容易聊得来，\n而且也很靠得住吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "c8b45952d319b4a6f19f32bdc567257ee631b3aa846326cad6774d9cac37859c", "ja": "自分が、頼りに……！\nもちろん！　そういうことなら任せるさー！", "zh": "我也能帮上忙……！当然！既然是这种事就交给我吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1038_013hib", "source_sha256": "13d6f53395078d372c864dde318288fc15cee231100c64a7497e12d738428674", "ja": "やよい、可奈！　わからないことがあったら\nなんでも自分に聞くんだぞ！", "zh": "弥生、可奈！要是有不懂的事，\n尽管来问我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1039_005yay", "source_sha256": "f716e6a984c7427439d4f1b47c5cc82dffa9d7b0a09270a7fe6f2e20ef9496d5", "ja": "は、はい……！", "zh": "好、好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "10d01fe3a5e84bff73caf4feabbfba7abbfa786c7194a22a9ca327285a5c4fb6", "ja": "それじゃあ……\nダンスの難しいところを……。", "zh": "那么……\n先从舞蹈中比较难的部分开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1041_013hib", "source_sha256": "710b60e0694eabc1a457c722b4a365044d327fac32937af386a31eeeecbb0a06", "ja": "うん、わかった！\nそれじゃあすぐ着替えてくるからね！", "zh": "嗯，知道了！\n那我马上就去换衣服哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "2a05edcf6f728c2d60b3203b2bae22c48c31e5a9f351015e540184899113810d", "ja": "このみさん、すみません。デュオ公演についても、\n響についてもフォローしてもらって……。", "zh": "この美小姐，抱歉。无论是双人公演，还是关于响的事，都麻烦您帮忙照顾了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "1ca2f2206308654c3b86dcf96cb0a7b16e52742f4a2ce13b85cab49036d740e2", "ja": "大丈夫♪　でも、前もってお姉さんに相談して\nくれていたら、完璧だったけど♪", "zh": "没事的♪不过，要是能事先找姐姐我商量一下，\n那就更完美了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1044_005yay", "source_sha256": "ab3b986aad5bb020fdd1aea4b771d6385aacfa0cea742787006864a7867e0720", "ja": "……。\nこのみさんって、大人だね……。", "zh": "……\n这个美也小姐，真是个大人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_04_1045_036kan", "source_sha256": "0b649e7d1a58311b37730c62b0b78a31c5c31a25d49cdbe8c281805b7d922647", "ja": "うん、うまく言えないけど、\n多分ああいう感じが、大人、なんだよね……。", "zh": "嗯，虽然我说不太清楚，\n不过大概那种感觉，就是所谓的“大人”吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
